[{:db/id "q-127915/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "0b628283-4da3-5123-b0f0-2a6ba0715389" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127915/selection/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" :answer/id #uuid "756736f5-f53e-5f2e-845c-b194756d5650" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127915/selection/16aebcc0f6d564cc83b305837e1b46e82b83ddec7178ee48b4217b6c6fdd025a" :answer/id #uuid "204ec977-b1ba-5c6f-9231-575c58f156dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127915/selection/a038cf4df09c65d711c1174200281cc22b8be446497e9dc942f4f18d8fa119e2" :answer/id #uuid "3ba431f3-3db3-5f36-905b-50991616823b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127915/selection/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856" :answer/id #uuid "2f78357d-0ab4-5517-ad10-1ff518f19027" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127915/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "bb2eddcf-f48f-5705-a434-dcc471f726e8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127915/selection/16aebcc0f6d564cc83b305837e1b46e82b83ddec7178ee48b4217b6c6fdd025a" :answer-field/choices ["q-127915/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-127915/selection/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" "q-127915/selection/16aebcc0f6d564cc83b305837e1b46e82b83ddec7178ee48b4217b6c6fdd025a" "q-127915/selection/a038cf4df09c65d711c1174200281cc22b8be446497e9dc942f4f18d8fa119e2" "q-127915/selection/4280bcd0914e40dbdc039bc97ee5d5baafd2654e75e9b692316d9c28c4842856"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127915" :question/id #uuid "588b7ac8-1d13-58bf-8be3-40e1395c4ae0" :question/math-academy-id "q-127915" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the $△\\,WXY,$ if $W(3,9,4),$ $X(1,7,3),$ $Y(6,12,8).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find the vectors $\\overset{\\to }{WX}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{WY}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{WX} & =x-w \\\\  & =(i+7j+3k)-(3i+9j+4k) \\\\  & =-2i-2j-k \\\\  & =⟨-2,-2,-1⟩ \\\\ \\overset{\\to }{WY} & =y-w \\\\  & =(6i+12j+8k)-(3i+9j+4k) \\\\  & =3i+3j+4k \\\\  & =⟨3,3,4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the formula to compute the cross product, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{WX}\\times \\overset{\\to }{WY} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -2 & -2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-2 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-2)\\cdot 4-3\\cdot (-1))i-((-2)\\cdot 4-3\\cdot (-1))j+((-2)\\cdot 3-3\\cdot (-2))k \\\\  & =-5i+5j \\\\  & =⟨-5,5,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\overset{\\to }{WX}$ and $\\overset{\\to }{WY}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =|\\overset{\\to }{WX}\\times \\overset{\\to }{WY}| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-5)^{2}+{5}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the area of the triangle is half of the area of the respective parallelogram. So, the area of $△\\,WXY$ is\n\n$$\n{A}_{△}=\\frac{1}{2}A=\\frac{5\\sqrt{2}}{2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127915/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7c30217a-484c-5c31-a2bf-413f04e0edea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127915"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
